    "market_commentary": "The SSY Atlantic Capesize Index increased 668 points week-on-week to 7,841 points. Fronthaul and transAtlantic earnings continued their upwards momentum over the past week. Fronthaul earnings went up $4,400/day to $33,750/day, while the round-voyage rates as assessed by SSY rose $2,750/day to $12,000/day.",
